    "body": "### Problem\n\nUsing AvanteChat, a subtask is running (tool calling) and everything freezes showing \"No search command found, please install fd or fdfind or rg\" as an error\n\n<img width=\"495\" height=\"132\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb50b290-56e7-433c-9127-ab6fae00acd9\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAsk AvanteChat to search a directory and get some context about coding files\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nSearching the directory shouldn't be freezing my code editor\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\n0.11.6\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nmacOS 26.5\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nMac terminal\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256\n\n### Installation\n\nMain repo",
